WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
Understanding South

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.794
Africa's Genocide Case Against Israel

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:04.629
Part Three: The Evidence.

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:05.255
Now that we're up to speed

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:06.047
on the context,

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:06.965
let me show you

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:08.967
what's in this 84 page document

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:10.593
accusing Israel of genocide.

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:11.761
The case starts right away

00:00:11.761 --> 00:00:12.846
with their main argument,

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.097
that the acts by Israel

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:15.515
are genocidal in character

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:16.725
because they are intended to bring

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:17.809
about the destruction

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:19.060
of the Palestinians.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:19.769
And then they list

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:21.479
the genocidal acts in question.

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:23.398
They argue that Israeli officials

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:25.608
have been publicly calling for genocide.

00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:26.526
There’s an entire section

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:27.819
with statements from the Israeli

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:29.946
president, prime minister, and the military

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:31.823
that South Africa is saying proves this.

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:32.490
This is important

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:33.867
because as we talked about in part two,

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:34.659
the definition

00:00:34.659 --> 00:00:37.120
legally of genocide must include

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.288
an explicit intent

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:39.956
to destroy Palestinians.

00:00:39.956 --> 00:00:40.582
Page 30

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:42.459
kind of gets to the heart of this case.

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:44.377
Killing over 21,000 Palestinians,

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:47.255
including 8000 children. Injuring 55,000.

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:50.008
Displacing 85% of the population,

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:50.800
attacking hospitals

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.887
and pushing Palestinians “to the brink of famine.”

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:54.929
There’s obviously much more to

00:00:54.929 --> 00:00:56.222
this case than I can cover here,

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:57.098
and I suggest that you

00:00:57.098 --> 00:00:58.099
read it on your own.

